caption: Chem Design Caps
technology-rule: chem-design-caps

Find the lowest Talent whose Level Cap and DPL Cap can contain the package.

| Required Talent | Level Cap | DPL Cap |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | 1 | 20 |
| 2 | 3 | 60 |
| 3 | 5 | 100 |
| 4 | 7 | 140 |
| 5 | 10 | 200 |
| 6 | 12 | 240 |
| 7 | 14 | 280 |
| 8 | 16 | 320 |
| 9 | 18 | 360 |
| 10 | 20 | 400 |

For Talent 1-4: Level Cap = 2T - 1

For Talent 5 or higher: Level Cap = 2T

The DPL Cap is:

DPL Cap = 20 * Level Cap

A formula must fit both limits.

Mastery is required to design any chem whose Required Talent is 5 or greater.
